1
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:02,513
Naik.

2
00:00:03,320 --> 00:00:03,669
Tunggu,

3
00:00:03,908 --> 00:00:05,281
aku nggak bisa naik kuda!

4
00:00:05,570 --> 00:00:06,135
Pegangan.

5
00:00:06,770 --> 00:00:07,779
Maju—!

6
00:00:08,055 --> 00:00:08,390
A-Ling,

7
00:00:08,572 --> 00:00:09,453
kamu belajar berkuda di mana?

8
00:00:09,984 --> 00:00:10,398
Jangan bicara,

9
00:00:10,799 --> 00:00:12,203
nanti lidahmu tergigit.

10
00:00:12,276 --> 00:00:15,622
Misi wajib: selamatkan Qin Shuang.

11
00:00:16,022 --> 00:00:18,451
Sisa waktu: dua hari.

12
00:00:18,854 --> 00:00:19,308
Kak Yan!

13
00:00:19,736 --> 00:00:22,262
Saudara-saudara dari Liuxi datang!

14
00:00:22,849 --> 00:00:25,211
Nona A-Ling terlalu cepat,

15
00:00:26,202 --> 00:00:28,672
kami naik bagal dua hari!

16
00:00:28,959 --> 00:00:30,167
Bekas rodanya masih baru.

17
00:00:30,246 --> 00:00:31,079
Ke dermaga penyeberangan.

18
00:00:34,268 --> 00:00:35,276
Seberangi sebelum gelap.

19
00:00:35,727 --> 00:00:38,113
Sampai seberang, orang ini lenyap.

20
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:39,779
Kalian bukan orang prefektur.

21
00:00:40,770 --> 00:00:41,752
Tugas prefektur,

22
00:00:41,992 --> 00:00:42,456
orang luar, minggir!

23
00:00:43,167 --> 00:00:44,452
Belasan golok…

24
00:00:46,395 --> 00:00:47,924
kita cuma berapa?

25
00:00:48,175 --> 00:00:49,315
Nggak perlu menang,

26
00:00:49,375 --> 00:00:50,624
asal tombaknya sampai ke tangannya.

27
00:00:51,185 --> 00:00:51,733
Xu Yan!

28
00:00:52,610 --> 00:00:53,994
Qin Shuang—tangkap!

29
00:00:55,295 --> 00:00:55,968
Pas sekali.

30
00:00:57,102 --> 00:00:58,964
Dapat!

31
00:01:05,202 --> 00:01:06,059
Rasakan!

32
00:01:06,402 --> 00:01:06,771
Kak Yan,

33
00:01:07,451 --> 00:01:09,841
aku berhasil memukulnya!

34
00:01:14,279 --> 00:01:14,815
Sekarang,

35
00:01:15,407 --> 00:01:16,524
giliran aku menggiringmu.

36
00:01:16,722 --> 00:01:19,203
Misi wajib selesai.

37
00:01:19,438 --> 00:01:20,672
Surat perintah penarikan prefektur!

38
00:01:20,731 --> 00:01:21,739
Siapa berani bergerak?

39
00:01:24,228 --> 00:01:25,766
Aku tahu siapa dia.

40
00:01:26,469 --> 00:01:26,917
Siapa dia,

41
00:01:27,197 --> 00:01:28,115
biar dia sendiri yang bilang.

42
00:01:28,380 --> 00:01:30,566
Poin suka A-Ling, lima puluh sembilan.

43
00:01:31,251 --> 00:01:31,851
Singkirkan tanganmu.

44
00:01:34,678 --> 00:01:35,713
Lepaskan aku,

45
00:01:36,554 --> 00:01:37,970
surat untuk ayahmu jadi milikmu.

46
00:01:38,046 --> 00:01:39,859
Ayahku…

47
00:01:39,926 --> 00:01:40,814
surat?

48
00:01:41,069 --> 00:01:41,534
Qin Shuang,

49
00:01:41,636 --> 00:01:42,361
kamu yang putuskan.

50
00:01:42,588 --> 00:01:43,419
Mau suratnya?

51
00:01:43,793 --> 00:01:44,792
Lepaskan aku.
